ext influences action, lineage should be preserved."}]},{"id":"blk-10451","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9670","text":"Anti-pattern 4: using graph memory for everything"}]},{"id":"blk-10452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9671","text":"Not every retrieval problem is best solved by graph structure alone. In many systems, "},{"id":"spn-9672","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9673","text":" works best alongside "},{"id":"spn-9674","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9675","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-9676","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9677","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-10453","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9678","text":"16. Related capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-10454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9679","text":"Closest related protocol capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-10455","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9680","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"}]}],"id":"blk-10456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9681","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"}]}],"id":"blk-10458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9682","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9683","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"}]}],"id":"blk-10462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9684","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]}],"id":"blk-10464","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9685","text":"Common high-value compositions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10467","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9686","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-9687","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9688","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9689","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9690","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10468","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9691","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9692","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9693","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-9694","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9695","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.plan"}]}],"id":"blk-10470","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9696","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9697","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9698","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9699","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9700","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10472","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10474","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9701","text":"17. Research references"}]},{"id":"blk-10475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9702","text":"This capability is informed by both memory-systems research and modern agent memory architecture work."}]},{"id":"blk-10476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9703","text":"Useful reference directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10477","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9704","text":"Atkinson & Shiffrin — staged memory models"}]}],"id":"blk-10478","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9705","text":"Endel Tulving — episodic vs semantic memory distinction"}]}],"id":"blk-10480","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9706","text":"Alan Baddeley — working memory and active memory use"}]}],"id":"blk-10482","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9707","text":"Larry Squire and related memory-systems research"}]}],"id":"blk-10484","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9708","text":"modern knowledge graph and graph retrieval systems"}]}],"id":"blk-10486","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9709","text":"graph-based agent memory architectures"}]}],"id":"blk-10488","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10491","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9710","text":"retrieval-augmented reasoning systems with structured memory"}]}],"id":"blk-10490","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9711","text":"The protocol does not claim to reproduce neuroscience literally. The value of these references is that they support treating memory as a family of functions rather than one monolithic feature."}]},{"id":"blk-10493","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9712","text":"18. Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-10494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9713","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9714","text":" is the [&] Protocol capability for graph-structured memory."}]},{"id":"blk-10495","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9715","text":"It is the right capability when an agent needs:"}]},{"id":"blk-10496","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9716","text":"durable structured recall"}]}],"id":"blk-10497","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9717","text":"relationship-aware enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-10499","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9718","text":"connected incident or research context"}]}],"id":"blk-10501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9719","text":"continual learning into linked knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-10503","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9720","text":"explainable memory that preserves structure"}]}],"id":"blk-10505","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9721","text":"In one sentence:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9722","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9723","text":" lets an agent remember not only facts, but how those facts connect."}]}],"id":"blk-10508","kind":"quote"}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieratet7oh43b2snoyrcwd5655qgtee3blcot6j4xfkqz3cwspeg6tja","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}